{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"超上同调"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"超上同调"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>普通的"},{"Local":{"url":"层上同调","text":"层上同调"}},{"Plain":"计算的是 (层的链复形范畴中的) Eilenberg–Maclane 对象的"},{"Local":{"url":"上同调","text":"上同调"}},{"Plain":"; 放宽限制, 考虑层范畴中一般链复形的上同调, 称之为超上同调.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>代数几何中 "},{"Local":{"url":"deRham上同调","text":"de Rham 上同调"}},{"Plain":"是 "},{"Local":{"url":"deRham复形","text":"de Rham 复形"}},{"Plain":"的超上同调.</p>\n"}]}}